1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:14,964
[Host] Welcome to Japanese Daily News. I'm Maya. Today is May thirtieth. Today's story is fun: the new Detective Conan movie has become a huge hit in Japan. Let's listen.

2
00:00:15,564 --> 00:00:21,036
[News] アニメ「名探偵コナン」の、映画のニュースです。

3
00:00:21,736 --> 00:00:26,416
[News] コナンは、とても人気があるアニメです。

4
00:00:27,115 --> 00:00:31,675
[News] 子供から大人まで、みんなが好きです。

5
00:00:32,375 --> 00:00:38,183
[News] コナンのアニメは、30年以上、続いています。

6
00:00:38,884 --> 00:00:44,140
[News] 毎年、春に、新しい映画が出ます。

7
00:00:44,840 --> 00:00:49,064
[News] 今年も、新しい映画が出ました。

8
00:00:49,764 --> 00:00:54,731
[News] 4月10日から、映画館で始まりました。

9
00:00:55,432 --> 00:01:00,112
[News] たくさんの人が、映画館に行きました。

10
00:01:00,811 --> 00:01:06,500
[News] この映画を見た人は、740万人です。

11
00:01:07,200 --> 00:01:11,951
[News] お金は、108億円を超えました。

12
00:01:12,652 --> 00:01:16,924
[News] これは、とても大きい数字です。

13
00:01:17,623 --> 00:01:24,128
[News] コナンの映画は、4年、続けて100億円を超えました。

14
00:01:24,828 --> 00:01:30,420
[News] これは、日本の映画で、初めてのことです。

15
00:01:31,120 --> 00:01:35,560
[News] コナンは、世界でも人気があります。

16
00:01:36,260 --> 00:01:41,420
[News] ファンは、次の映画も楽しみにしています。

17
00:01:42,120 --> 00:01:43,751
[Host] Let's break it down.

18
00:01:44,352 --> 00:01:49,680
[Slow] コナンは、とても人気があるアニメです。

19
00:01:50,480 --> 00:01:53,215
[Host] Conan is a very popular anime.

20
00:01:53,816 --> 00:01:56,048
[Vocab] 人気

21
00:01:56,447 --> 00:02:02,855
[Host] It means popularity, or being popular. You attach it to anything that lots of people love.

22
00:02:03,456 --> 00:02:08,663
[Slow] 子供から大人まで、みんなが好きです。

23
00:02:09,463 --> 00:02:12,943
[Host] Everyone, from children to adults, loves it.

24
00:02:13,544 --> 00:02:15,752
[Vocab] 大人

25
00:02:16,151 --> 00:02:21,168
[Host] It means adult, a grown-up. The opposite is the word for child.

26
00:02:21,768 --> 00:02:28,391
[Slow] コナンのアニメは、30年以上、続いています。

27
00:02:29,192 --> 00:02:33,056
[Host] The Conan anime has continued for more than thirty years.

28
00:02:33,656 --> 00:02:35,912
[Vocab] 続く

29
00:02:36,312 --> 00:02:42,192
[Host] It means to continue or to last. Use it for anything that keeps going over time.

30
00:02:42,792 --> 00:02:47,616
[Slow] 今年も、新しい映画が出ました。

31
00:02:48,415 --> 00:02:51,319
[Host] This year too, a new movie came out.

32
00:02:51,919 --> 00:02:54,536
[Vocab] 新しい

33
00:02:54,936 --> 00:02:59,951
[Host] It means new. It's an adjective, so it can sit right in front of a noun.

34
00:03:00,551 --> 00:03:06,216
[Slow] 4月10日から、映画館で始まりました。

35
00:03:07,015 --> 00:03:09,919
[Host] It started in theaters from April tenth.

36
00:03:10,520 --> 00:03:12,943
[Vocab] 映画館

37
00:03:13,343 --> 00:03:19,800
[Host] It means movie theater. The first part means movie, and the ending points to a building or hall.

38
00:03:20,400 --> 00:03:26,903
[Slow] この映画を見た人は、740万人です。

39
00:03:27,704 --> 00:03:32,527
[Host] The number of people who saw this movie is seven million four hundred thousand.

40
00:03:33,127 --> 00:03:35,192
[Vocab] 映画

41
00:03:35,592 --> 00:03:41,592
[Host] It means movie or film. This is one of the most useful everyday words you'll learn.

42
00:03:42,192 --> 00:03:47,616
[Slow] お金は、108億円を超えました。

43
00:03:48,415 --> 00:03:51,632
[Host] The money went over ten point eight billion yen.

44
00:03:52,231 --> 00:03:54,391
[Vocab] 超える

45
00:03:54,792 --> 00:04:00,360
[Host] It means to exceed, or to go over. Use it whenever a number passes a line.

46
00:04:00,960 --> 00:04:05,831
[Slow] これは、とても大きい数字です。

47
00:04:06,632 --> 00:04:08,792
[Host] This is a very big number.

48
00:04:09,391 --> 00:04:11,671
[Vocab] 数字

49
00:04:12,072 --> 00:04:17,567
[Host] It means a number or figure, the kind you write down. Think of digits on a page.

50
00:04:18,168 --> 00:04:24,552
[Slow] これは、日本の映画で、初めてのことです。

51
00:04:25,351 --> 00:04:29,000
[Host] This is the first time ever for a Japanese movie.

52
00:04:29,600 --> 00:04:32,024
[Vocab] 初めて

53
00:04:32,423 --> 00:04:37,271
[Host] It means for the first time. People also say it when meeting someone new.

54
00:04:37,872 --> 00:04:42,935
[Slow] コナンは、世界でも人気があります。

55
00:04:43,735 --> 00:04:46,687
[Host] Conan is popular around the world too.

56
00:04:47,288 --> 00:04:49,519
[Vocab] 世界

57
00:04:49,920 --> 00:04:54,480
[Host] It means the world. Add it to say something is famous worldwide.

58
00:04:55,079 --> 00:05:00,959
[Slow] ファンは、次の映画も楽しみにしています。

59
00:05:01,759 --> 00:05:04,855
[Host] Fans are looking forward to the next movie too.

60
00:05:05,456 --> 00:05:07,783
[Vocab] 楽しみ

61
00:05:08,184 --> 00:05:13,752
[Host] It means something you look forward to. It carries a warm, excited feeling.

